<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</title>
<headline>Swiss launch three-month money market claims.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing three-month money market claims series 3.375 to be paid for on February 27, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation follows end of subscriptions on February 25.</p>
<p>The previous issue of three-month claims series 3.374, paid for on February 20, raised 1.063 billion francs and was priced at 99.622 to yield 1.501 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- Zurich editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
